    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "PRIME CORNER COMMERICAL & RESIDENTIAL PROPERY -IN THE HEART OF CONG VILLAGE \r\nExceptional opportunity to acquire a prominent corner retail premises with one -bedroom residential accommodation overhead, located in the very heart of the popular and picturesque village of Cong.\r\nOccupying a high-profile position at the juction of Abbey Street and River View  Street, this property offers excellent visibility and strong passing footfall. \r\nThe premise presents an exciting opportunity for an entrepreneur while also residing on the first floor. \r\nThe ground floor extends to approx.28sq.m and comprises a bright open-plan retail area with excellent street frontage, kithenette, WC and additional storage.\r\nThe first floor provides comfortable one-bedroom residential accommodation, comprising a spacious kitchen/dining/living area, bedroom & bathroom.\r\nThe combination of commercial premises and residential accommodation makes this an attractive live-work opportunity or potiential base for a variety of businesses.\r\nCong enjoys a strong tourism market and all year -round local activity, with the property benefiting from a particulary prominent trading position within the village."
      }
